{"video":"iz6p2OgH-Z4","lines":[{"t":[0,0.8],"en":"-I don't know, man."},{"t":[0.8,1.8],"en":"I mean, when you think about it,"},{"t":[1.8,3.2],"en":"Cabo is really the third world."},{"t":[3.2,5.7],"en":"I don't go to a place like that to see more poverty, you know?"},{"t":[5.7,7],"en":"You go there, you get some glamour."},{"t":[7,8.8],"en":"-Hey."},{"t":[8.8,10.3],"en":"Mike? -Hey."},{"t":[10.3,11.3],"en":"-What are you doing here?"},{"t":[11.3,13.9],"en":"-Well, you know, just taking you up on your offer to party."},{"t":[13.9,15.6],"en":"So, ta-da."},{"t":[15.6,18.8],"en":"-That is so awesome, man. -All right."},{"t":[18.8,21.4],"en":"-And you brought this guy. -Yeah."},{"t":[21.4,24.6],"en":"-Oh!"},{"t":[24.6,26.2],"en":"-Brian, it's Michael and Dwight."},{"t":[26.2,27.7],"en":"-I know it's you guys. -Okay."},{"t":[27.7,29.1],"en":"-I'm so psyched you're here."},{"t":[29.1,33.3],"en":"-Alright, let's get a drink."},{"t":[33.3,34.2],"en":"Let's do it."},{"t":[36.8,39.3],"en":"Guys, I want you to meet a really good friend of mine."},{"t":[39.3,40.2],"en":"This is Troy."},{"t":[40.2,42.3],"en":"-Hey, nice to meet you. -How you doing?"},{"t":[42.3,44.3],"en":"-Hey, Dwight."},{"t":[44.3,46.2],"en":"You resemble the Tolkien character."},{"t":[46.2,47.7],"en":"-Ah, he basically is, man."},{"t":[47.7,49.2],"en":"He's a regular banking wizard."},{"t":[49.2,50.6],"en":"-No, no, no, not a wizard."},{"t":[50.6,52.6],"en":"A hobbit."},{"t":[52.6,54],"en":"-Bottle service, y'all?"},{"t":[54,55.1],"en":"-Oh, okay."},{"t":[55.1,58.2],"en":"All I know is I would like some chicken fingers"},{"t":[58.2,59.4],"en":"and a Midori Sour."},{"t":[59.4,61.4],"en":"-We don't serve food here."},{"t":[61.4,62.4],"en":"-Oh, okay."},{"t":[62.4,64.3],"en":"Then just bring me two cups."},{"t":[64.3,68.3],"en":"One with olives and another one filled with marachino cherries."},{"t":[70.3,73.3],"en":"-Do you live in a regular-sized house?"},{"t":[73.3,74.4],"en":"-Yeah, he's a normal guy."},{"t":[74.4,75.4],"en":"He's cool."},{"t":[75.4,77.4],"en":"-Wait, Shrewd, man."},{"t":[77.4,78.4],"en":"How's Shrewd Farms?"},{"t":[78.4,79.3],"en":"-Good."},{"t":[79.3,81.9],"en":"-This guy owns his own beet farm."},{"t":[81.9,82.8],"en":"-Insane."},{"t":[82.8,85.1],"en":"-Well, it's weevil season, but we were prepared."},{"t":[85.1,86.3],"en":"-Weevils?"},{"t":[86.3,88],"en":"What a crazy word, man."},{"t":[88,89.2],"en":"I don't even know what that means."},{"t":[89.2,90.2],"en":"What does that mean?"},{"t":[90.2,92.9],"en":"-They lay their eggs inside the unripe beetroot."},{"t":[92.9,95.1],"en":"Then, come springtime, the babies eat their way out."},{"t":[95.1,96.3],"en":"-Crazy!"},{"t":[96.3,98.5],"en":"-That's too much for me, man."},{"t":[98.5,99.8],"en":"-I'm gonna head to the bathroom."},{"t":[99.8,101.3],"en":"-You've already been several times."},{"t":[101.3,102.8],"en":"-Yeah?"},{"t":[102.8,104.4],"en":"-Maybe you have some kind of bladder infection."},{"t":[104.4,105.5],"en":"-I don't know, maybe."},{"t":[105.5,107.4],"en":"-I'll order you some cranberry juice."},{"t":[107.4,108.8],"en":"-Vodka, you're the best."},{"t":[110.9,112.3],"en":"-Do you have powers?"},{"t":[112.3,132.6],"en":"-Dude, you're the best."}]}
